#: tools/pkg/chamesle-drivers/files/usr/bin/chamesle-drivers:77
msgid "Open source driver (nouveau)"
msgstr "오픈 소스 드라이버 (nouveau)"

#: tools/pkg/chamesle-drivers/files/usr/bin/chamesle-drivers:76
msgid "This card is too old for the NVIDIA driver, the open source one is used."
msgstr "이 카드는 NVIDIA 드라이버를 쓰기에는 너무 오래되어 오픈 소스 드라이버를 씁니다."

#: tools/pkg/chamesle-drivers/files/usr/bin/chamesle-drivers:79
msgid "This Wi-Fi chip needs Broadcom's driver to work."
msgstr "이 Wi-Fi 칩은 Broadcom 드라이버가 있어야 작동합니다."

#: tools/pkg/chamesle-drivers/files/usr/bin/chamesle-drivers:80
