#: tools/pkg/chamesle-drivers/files/usr/bin/chamesle-drivers:90
msgid "HP's own drivers support more printers and scanners."
msgstr "HP 자체 드라이버는 더 많은 프린터와 스캐너를 지원합니다."

#: tools/pkg/chamesle-drivers/files/usr/bin/chamesle-drivers:91
