msgstr "할 일 없음"

#: tools/pkg/chamesle-drivers/files/usr/bin/chamesle-drivers:131
msgid "Your hardware works with the drivers that are already installed."
msgstr "하드웨어가 이미 설치된 드라이버로 잘 작동합니다."

