#: tools/pkg/chamesle-drivers/files/usr/bin/chamesle-drivers:149
msgid "Installing a driver needs your password, and usually a restart after."
msgstr "드라이버를 설치하려면 비밀번호가 필요하고, 보통 설치 후 다시 시작해야 합니다."

#: tools/pkg/chamesle-drivers/files/usr/bin/chamesle-drivers:159
